    "Download a small AI model once. After that, Closet categorizes items and suggests outfits with no API key, no account, and no network connection required.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download a small AI model once. After that, Closet categorizes items and suggests outfits with no API key, no account, and no network connection required."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lade einmal ein kleines KI-Modell herunter. Danach ordnet Closet Kleidungsstücke ein und schlägt Outfits vor – ohne API-Schlüssel, Konto oder Netzwerkverbindung."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Téléchargez une seule fois un petit modèle d’IA. Closet pourra ensuite classer les vêtements et suggérer des tenues sans clé API, compte ni connexion réseau."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scarica una sola volta un piccolo modello IA. Poi Closet classificherà i capi e suggerirà outfit senza chiave API, account o connessione di rete."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Baixe um pequeno modelo de IA uma vez. Depois disso, o Closet categoriza peças e sugere looks sem chave de API, conta ou conexão com a rede."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Descarga una vez un pequeño modelo de IA. Después, Closet clasifica prendas y sugiere conjuntos sin clave API, cuenta ni conexión."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只需下载一次小型 AI 模型，Closet 就能在无需 API 密钥、账户或网络的情况下分类衣物并推荐穿搭。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小さなAIモデルを一度ダウンロードするだけで、ClosetはAPIキー、アカウント、ネット接続なしに衣類を分類し、コーデを提案できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "작은 AI 모델을 한 번 다운로드하면 Closet이 API 키, 계정, 인터넷 없이 의류를 분류하고 코디를 추천합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只要下載一次小型 AI 模型，之後 Closet 就能分類單品並建議穿搭，不需要 API 金鑰、帳號或網路連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
